mac-enhancer
Copyright (c) 2026 mac-enhancer contributors, MIT License (see LICENSE).

mac-enhancer is an independent, clean-room implementation of an AI print-size
image upscaler for macOS / Apple Silicon. It reuses ideas and formulas that are
free to use (pixels = inches x DPI, tiled super-resolution, ...), and no source
code, strings, translations or assets of any other upscaler application.

It builds on the open-source work below. Their licenses are reproduced in full
because binary builds (the .app / .dmg) include or load their code.


