Real-ESRGAN  (BSD 3-Clause)
https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN
================================================================================
The network architectures and the pre-trained models this program runs:
RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth, realesr-general-x4v3.pth and realesr-general-wdn-x4v3.pth.
The weight files are NOT part of this repository or of the .app/.dmg: mac-enhancer
downloads them, at the user's request, from the Real-ESRGAN GitHub releases and
checks them against a pinned SHA-256. The Real-ESRGAN repository carries the
license below and states no separate license for the weights; check upstream
before redistributing them, including the terms of their training data.

